  "decision": "Reject reliability-order-only integration. Signed LLR ordering slightly improved the best order-two target witness (108 versus 112) but reduced target coverage from 26 to 8 and remained far behind BP-OSD's weight 56 on identical targets. The const-generic adapter also raised default-path instructions by 5.24 percent, so its code shape is rejected independently. A future bridge must carry an affine BP hard decision or residual, not just a permutation, and must isolate codegen from the random kernel."
